# Allowlist: ignore everything, then let back in only what the Cloud Run image needs.
# (Keeps .env, .git, .venv, the desktop app and tests out of the container.)
*
!avatar_api/requirements.txt
!avatar_api/*.py
!images/
!lumo_app/build/web/
!lumo_extension/*.js
!lumo_extension/*.json
!lumo_extension/*.md
!lumo_extension/app/
!lumo_extension/lumo/
